WEBVTT

00:00:01.290 --> 00:00:03.180
<i>Ocoho and Melie</i>

00:00:03.180 --> 00:00:06.080
<i>were summoned to the palace
 upon returning from Caillte's forest.</i>

00:00:06.080 --> 00:00:08.530
<i>They were charged with insubordination,</i>

00:00:08.530 --> 00:00:11.730
<i>but Mordred's counsel saved them
 from their dilemma.</i>

00:00:12.330 --> 00:00:15.930
<i>Meanwhile, Seth continued 
to train hard under Myr,</i>

00:00:15.930 --> 00:00:18.420
<i>but he was still unable 
to control his power.</i>

00:00:18.890 --> 00:00:22.580
<i>A mysterious darkness nearly engulfed 
Seth in the realm of Sidh,</i>

00:00:23.260 --> 00:00:27.510
<i>and Seth's misgivings about Piodon
 grew even greater.</i>

00:00:30.170 --> 00:00:32.370
It's getting to be more 
than I can handle.

00:00:32.370 --> 00:00:34.090
That's all for now.

00:00:39.020 --> 00:00:43.270
I was right.
 It lost sight of what it was searching for.

00:00:43.270 --> 00:00:44.670
It's withdrawing.

00:00:45.350 --> 00:00:51.910
Seth, why did that "brother" of yours 
put something like this in you?

00:00:51.910 --> 00:00:54.990
Was he really trying to help you?

00:01:19.220 --> 00:01:21.190
Ouch...

00:01:22.210 --> 00:01:26.100
It's good that you have awareness 
of your freeloader now,

00:01:26.100 --> 00:01:29.230
but we can't seem to get 
any further than that.

00:01:29.230 --> 00:01:34.120
I think that this would work 
if we just had the right catalyst.

00:01:34.120 --> 00:01:36.720
I thought the same thing.

00:01:36.720 --> 00:01:39.030
Jill, bring the you-know-what.

00:01:39.030 --> 00:01:39.990
Of course.

00:01:42.890 --> 00:01:45.310
We do this with these, and...

00:01:46.080 --> 00:01:47.330
There.

00:01:48.570 --> 00:01:50.460
What is this?

00:01:50.930 --> 00:01:53.550
I-It's well...

00:01:55.270 --> 00:02:00.850
an armband made of the hair
 from a very important part of my body.

00:02:01.270 --> 00:02:02.190
Huh?

00:02:04.350 --> 00:02:07.980
What?!

00:03:37.980 --> 00:03:43.990
<b>The Qualifications of a Knight 
-Quality-</b>

00:03:40.220 --> 00:03:41.770
<i>"The Qualifications of a Knight."</i>

00:03:46.540 --> 00:03:48.990
What the heck did you put on me?!

00:03:51.810 --> 00:03:53.870
I'm kidding! It was just a joke!

00:03:54.450 --> 00:03:57.270
Jeez... Don't freak me out like that.

00:03:58.310 --> 00:04:00.380
So... what is it?

00:04:00.380 --> 00:04:03.810
Oh, just a little idea I had.

00:04:03.810 --> 00:04:06.310
Jill and I were talking, you see...

00:04:06.990 --> 00:04:09.270
Do you feel anything?

00:04:12.900 --> 00:04:16.270
What is this? It's really warm.

00:04:16.700 --> 00:04:20.820
That's made from a special tree
 found in this forest.

00:04:21.250 --> 00:04:26.910
You remember when we used Jill's sap
 to heal your wounds, right?

00:04:26.910 --> 00:04:28.160
Yeah.

00:04:28.160 --> 00:04:33.710
Through Jill's sap,
 you developed a bond with her,

00:04:33.710 --> 00:04:35.770
and with this forest.

00:04:42.300 --> 00:04:44.510
I hope you're grateful.

00:04:44.510 --> 00:04:47.510
Yeah! I really appreciate it.

00:04:49.710 --> 00:04:53.480
That armband itself is your bond.

00:04:53.480 --> 00:04:56.340
So long as you wear it,

00:04:56.340 --> 00:05:01.400
you will never forget that you are 
a human who lives with this forest.

00:05:01.400 --> 00:05:03.260
Thanks!

00:05:03.260 --> 00:05:06.730
Okay, Myr,
 let's get back to training now!

00:05:06.730 --> 00:05:11.770
Sure, but first, there's something
 I need to warn you about.

00:05:13.190 --> 00:05:16.550
It's about that strange darkness.

00:05:19.190 --> 00:05:22.920
It's a darkness called forth
 by the freeloader in that peephole.

00:05:23.590 --> 00:05:26.320
Be very careful of him.

00:05:26.320 --> 00:05:27.930
Yes, it's true.

00:05:28.360 --> 00:05:30.530
If he engulfs you completely,

00:05:30.530 --> 00:05:34.050
you might never regain 
your own consciousness.

00:05:34.670 --> 00:05:39.060
Jill and I come and go
 from the realm of Sidh every day,

00:05:39.060 --> 00:05:42.830
but I've never seen anything 
as hostile as that.

00:05:44.630 --> 00:05:46.650
Well, long story short,

00:05:46.650 --> 00:05:50.450
you just need to learn
 to completely seal away that freeloader,

00:05:50.450 --> 00:05:52.370
and this will all be solved.

00:05:52.960 --> 00:05:57.950
It all depends
 on the state of your heart.

00:05:59.470 --> 00:06:00.990
You're right.

00:06:00.990 --> 00:06:06.510
I promised Melie and the others 
that I'd learn to control myself.

00:06:06.990 --> 00:06:09.860
No matter how long it takes,
 I'm gonna do it!

00:06:12.250 --> 00:06:15.650
That's the spirit!
 It'd be no fun otherwise!

00:06:15.650 --> 00:06:16.750
Yeah!

00:06:16.750 --> 00:06:20.920
I bet Melie and Ocoho are working hard
 at their own drills now.

00:06:20.920 --> 00:06:23.260
I can't fall behind!

00:06:39.300 --> 00:06:40.540
What's going on?

00:06:40.540 --> 00:06:43.870
A Nemesis has appeared in the farmland
 on the outskirts of town.

00:06:43.870 --> 00:06:45.230
A Spectre?

00:06:45.230 --> 00:06:48.050
No, it seems to be a regular Nemesis.

00:06:48.050 --> 00:06:49.430
All right.

00:06:49.430 --> 00:06:54.770
Knights-sorcerers and apprentices, 
be ready to depart in two minutes!

00:06:54.770 --> 00:06:58.060
Those who fall behind
 will first be punished by the fist,

00:06:58.060 --> 00:07:01.870
and second... uh, s-second...

00:07:02.410 --> 00:07:05.860
Anyway, you'll be punished! Got it?!

00:07:05.860 --> 00:07:07.010
Yes, sir!

00:07:07.010 --> 00:07:10.470
Trainees, you guys can follow me!

00:07:10.470 --> 00:07:12.730
Stay away from the frontlines,
 whatever you do!

00:07:12.730 --> 00:07:13.620
Right!

00:07:16.020 --> 00:07:20.010
You're always in such a hurry,
 Lord Brangoire.

00:07:20.010 --> 00:07:21.330
Lord de Gulis!

00:07:21.330 --> 00:07:23.420
To help you restore your honor,

00:07:23.420 --> 00:07:26.280
I've received special permission 
to launch an attack.

00:07:26.280 --> 00:07:30.020
You should be extremely grateful!

00:07:32.420 --> 00:07:35.140
My beautiful... Melie!

00:07:35.500 --> 00:07:39.130
Could it be that you will be joining us
 in this operation?

00:07:39.130 --> 00:07:40.860
Y-Yes...

00:07:40.860 --> 00:07:43.590
How very brave you are!

00:07:43.590 --> 00:07:48.330
When you dance upon the battlefield, 
truly, you are as a valkyrie!

00:07:48.330 --> 00:07:51.130
You have charmed not only myself,
 but many, many heroes.

00:07:51.130 --> 00:07:55.910
Perhaps your presence
 will even raise the dead!

00:07:55.910 --> 00:07:57.510
Uh-huh...

00:07:57.510 --> 00:08:01.200
Ah, but battling a Nemesis 
is extremely dangerous.

00:08:01.200 --> 00:08:01.660
Yeah...

00:08:01.660 --> 00:08:07.630
You should stay in the safest place
 in the world: behind me.

00:08:07.630 --> 00:08:09.550
Uh... right.

00:08:09.550 --> 00:08:14.350
Now, this is a charm
 that will protect you from the Nemesis.

00:08:22.940 --> 00:08:24.960
I-I'm so sorry!

00:08:24.960 --> 00:08:27.670
Oh, no, no! This is nothing!

00:08:27.670 --> 00:08:29.780
All according to my plan!

00:08:30.670 --> 00:08:32.160
Gosh, this hurts...

00:08:32.160 --> 00:08:34.570
That's enough, Lord de Gulis!

00:08:35.020 --> 00:08:37.950
Are you aware that this is an emergency?

00:08:38.900 --> 00:08:42.230
As always, you lack elegance.

00:08:42.230 --> 00:08:43.390
What?!

00:08:43.390 --> 00:08:46.260
It's because this is an emergency
 that we must relax.

00:08:46.260 --> 00:08:48.950
Anxiety and impatience have a way of spreading.

00:08:48.950 --> 00:08:53.310
We Knights-sorcerers are
 the people's star of hope.

00:08:53.310 --> 00:08:56.090
We must be elegant at all times.

00:08:56.910 --> 00:08:58.480
Oh, let's just go!

00:08:58.480 --> 00:09:00.750
Knights, follow me!

00:09:00.750 --> 00:09:01.560
Yes, sir!

00:09:02.910 --> 00:09:04.730
Well, let's go.

00:09:05.900 --> 00:09:07.690
Time to take out a Nemesis.

00:09:21.060 --> 00:09:22.080
Petro!

00:09:31.330 --> 00:09:33.770
W-We're safe?

00:09:33.770 --> 00:09:35.890
Oh, great Merlin!

00:09:41.710 --> 00:09:44.520
That was quite a close call, my people!

00:09:44.520 --> 00:09:46.190
My name is Gulis.

00:09:46.190 --> 00:09:50.690
When folks talk about Gulis the Nemesis Slayer,
 they're talking about me!

00:09:52.530 --> 00:09:54.530
Oh, that's him?

00:09:57.660 --> 00:09:58.780
I can't see!

00:09:58.780 --> 00:10:02.340
Oh, please!
 This is all according to plan!

00:10:04.910 --> 00:10:06.550
Lord de Gulis!

00:10:06.550 --> 00:10:09.170
I can't have you throwing my troops
 into disarray!

00:10:10.750 --> 00:10:16.050
But there are lives right here
 who were saved by my quick judgment.

00:10:17.780 --> 00:10:20.620
Knights! Assess the damage,

00:10:20.620 --> 00:10:23.020
and begin cleaning up the Nemesis!

00:10:23.020 --> 00:10:24.010
Yes, sir!

00:10:25.860 --> 00:10:29.440
Wow... 
He took out the Nemesis with one strike.

00:10:29.810 --> 00:10:32.750
I didn't realize he was so strong.

00:10:32.750 --> 00:10:34.200
He <i>is</i> weird, though.

00:10:34.200 --> 00:10:38.640
Yeah. Lord de Gulis is one of the strongest
 of all Knights-sorcerers.

00:10:38.640 --> 00:10:40.450
He <i>is</i> weird, though.

00:10:40.830 --> 00:10:46.130
Lord de Gulis is also Mordred 
and Sagramore's guardian.

00:10:46.670 --> 00:10:49.830
Thanks to him, 
their futures are secure.

00:10:51.110 --> 00:10:54.590
Of course, they were brilliant to begin with,
 so that was expected.

00:10:55.540 --> 00:10:56.840
But...

00:10:56.840 --> 00:10:59.010
Even though they're fellow Knights-sorcerers,

00:10:59.010 --> 00:11:04.410
he and Lord Brangoire seem... 
well... very different.

00:11:05.100 --> 00:11:08.790
You mean how it seems
 that they don't get along?

00:11:08.790 --> 00:11:10.810
You can't blame them, though.

00:11:10.810 --> 00:11:15.360
They have totally opposite ideas 
about how knights should be.

00:11:15.360 --> 00:11:17.730
"How knights should be"?

00:11:18.170 --> 00:11:22.620
Lord de Gulis values 
exceptional individual abilities.

00:11:22.620 --> 00:11:27.740
He insists that the resourceful
 should be the champions who lead the people.

00:11:25.590 --> 00:11:28.640
All of you! Praise me!

00:11:28.640 --> 00:11:33.950
And Lord Brangoire values order 
and teamwork above all else.

00:11:29.930 --> 00:11:31.830
You'll be punished by the fist!

00:11:34.270 --> 00:11:37.750
Isn't it good for knights 
to value teamwork?

00:11:37.750 --> 00:11:39.860
Yeah...

00:11:39.860 --> 00:11:43.840
But I think Lord Brangoire 
is too tightly bound by it.

00:11:44.520 --> 00:11:49.470
Also, I don't think he cares 
what anyone thinks of him.

00:11:49.470 --> 00:11:51.190
I see.

00:11:51.190 --> 00:11:55.110
So even fellow knights think 
about things differently.

00:11:55.110 --> 00:11:57.230
Of course they do.

00:11:57.230 --> 00:12:00.510
Sort of like how 
you don't always obey orders.

00:12:00.510 --> 00:12:05.120
S-Says the one who dragged us into Caillte's forest
 after I tried to stop her!

00:12:05.120 --> 00:12:07.610
What are you two blabbering about?!

00:12:07.610 --> 00:12:08.670
Yikes!

00:12:10.500 --> 00:12:13.660
That girl again? Honestly...

00:12:13.660 --> 00:12:15.400
Wh-What's that?

00:12:15.400 --> 00:12:18.130
Lord Brangoire! There's trouble!

00:12:18.130 --> 00:12:19.290
What's going on?

00:12:19.290 --> 00:12:21.070
A new Nemesis is attacking!

00:12:21.070 --> 00:12:23.090
What?! Where is it?!

00:12:23.090 --> 00:12:24.750
Over the hill from here,

00:12:24.750 --> 00:12:26.390
near a settlement to the north!

00:12:26.390 --> 00:12:28.870
It appears to be quite a large one!

00:12:30.460 --> 00:12:32.540
Cease your work for the time being!

00:12:32.540 --> 00:12:35.570
All of you, we're going to take out
 that giant Nemesis!

00:12:35.570 --> 00:12:36.310
Yes, sir!

00:12:38.400 --> 00:12:40.710
A giant Nemesis, eh?

00:12:40.710 --> 00:12:42.030
Interesting.

00:12:42.030 --> 00:12:46.530
Gulis squad! 
Follow your elegant leader!

00:12:46.530 --> 00:12:47.530
Yes, sir!

00:12:48.870 --> 00:12:51.600
How dare Lord de Gulis act on his own?!

00:12:51.600 --> 00:12:53.870
Brangoire squad, don't fall behind!

00:12:53.870 --> 00:12:54.660
Yes, sir!

00:12:54.660 --> 00:12:56.090
We're going, too!

00:12:56.090 --> 00:12:57.040
Right!

00:12:59.470 --> 00:13:01.450
How inspiring!

00:13:01.450 --> 00:13:05.410
May the great Merlin's blessing 
be with them all!

00:13:05.410 --> 00:13:08.800
You can do it, knights!

00:13:11.460 --> 00:13:13.860
Thank you, little one!

00:13:13.860 --> 00:13:17.190
Grow big and strong like me, you hear?!

00:13:18.590 --> 00:13:24.410
You should give more consideration 
to the Knights-sorcerers' image.

00:13:24.410 --> 00:13:25.950
There's no need.

00:13:25.950 --> 00:13:29.640
I'm only concerned with ensuring 
that the people are safe.

00:13:29.640 --> 00:13:33.790
That aside, the matter of greatest importance
 here is that Nemesis.

00:13:35.260 --> 00:13:36.990
We should approach with caution.

00:13:36.990 --> 00:13:40.130
The two of us should stand at the head
 of our respective squads

00:13:40.130 --> 00:13:42.620
and share our senses using Gysoni,

00:13:42.620 --> 00:13:44.670
while maintaining a distance 
from that thing—

00:13:44.670 --> 00:13:46.000
Ah, that's it!

00:13:46.000 --> 00:13:48.210
I just had a great idea!

00:13:48.210 --> 00:13:51.180
You and I will make this a contest!

00:13:51.180 --> 00:13:52.440
What?!

00:13:52.440 --> 00:13:57.020
The squad that captures the Nemesis first
 will be treated by the losers!

00:13:57.020 --> 00:14:00.290
Nonsense! 
I won't play such a silly game!

00:14:00.290 --> 00:14:03.700
Now, my men! Charge!

00:14:03.700 --> 00:14:04.690
Yes, sir!

00:14:06.370 --> 00:14:09.070
Brangoire squad, let's go!

00:14:09.070 --> 00:14:10.450
Yes, sir!

00:14:10.860 --> 00:14:13.120
You can do it, golden knight!

00:14:13.120 --> 00:14:15.660
Don't let that other knight beat you!

00:14:17.500 --> 00:14:20.460
Thank you!

00:14:20.460 --> 00:14:22.770
Stick with me!

00:14:22.770 --> 00:14:23.980
Gysoni!

00:14:23.980 --> 00:14:25.460
Gysoni!

00:14:27.010 --> 00:14:29.470
Ocoho? What's the matter?

00:14:29.470 --> 00:14:31.700
The others are leaving.

00:14:31.700 --> 00:14:35.470
If we don't go with them, 
we'll get in trouble again.

00:14:35.470 --> 00:14:36.770
I feel something.

00:14:36.770 --> 00:14:37.910
Huh?

00:14:37.910 --> 00:14:40.690
It's... a really bad feeling.

00:14:40.690 --> 00:14:41.980
Is this...

00:14:46.910 --> 00:14:48.380
It's not just one!

00:14:48.380 --> 00:14:51.990
It's a whole group of Echo Nemesis!

00:14:51.990 --> 00:14:58.000
<b>[The armband received from Myr] 
Myr's handmade armband. It cuts off the darkness inside Seth
 and strengthens his bond with the world.</b>

00:15:01.250 --> 00:15:02.870
Run! Hurry!

00:15:06.530 --> 00:15:08.260
We can't stop them this way!

00:15:08.260 --> 00:15:10.180
The Echoes are scattering!

00:15:10.180 --> 00:15:13.780
If we mess up,
 innocent people will be hurt!

00:15:14.350 --> 00:15:16.500
What will be, will be!

00:15:16.500 --> 00:15:17.600
Ocoho!

00:15:24.030 --> 00:15:25.440
Carserem!

00:15:28.890 --> 00:15:33.220
Putting everyone in cages to protect them
 while you defeat the Echoes?

00:15:33.220 --> 00:15:34.070
That's brilliant!

00:15:36.780 --> 00:15:38.470
The monster's legs!

00:15:38.900 --> 00:15:40.860
I-I'm sorry!

00:15:40.860 --> 00:15:43.580
But you'll be safe inside here!

00:15:43.580 --> 00:15:45.150
Petro?

00:15:45.150 --> 00:15:46.590
Petro isn't here!

00:15:50.510 --> 00:15:52.110
Stop!

00:15:55.750 --> 00:15:57.210
Take care of them!

00:15:57.210 --> 00:15:57.850
Right!

00:16:00.740 --> 00:16:03.520
Stop!

00:16:04.490 --> 00:16:05.900
Just in time.

00:16:05.900 --> 00:16:07.880
But I was about to defeat them!

00:16:07.880 --> 00:16:09.370
At your age?

00:16:09.370 --> 00:16:11.660
With just a stick,
 and without any armor?

00:16:11.660 --> 00:16:15.510
That golden knight told me
 to do my best!

00:16:15.510 --> 00:16:19.040
That's true.
 I'm sure you'll be strong in the future.

00:16:19.040 --> 00:16:20.000
Yeah!

00:16:20.430 --> 00:16:22.810
The Echoes are filling the entire field.

00:16:23.260 --> 00:16:26.070
We can't let them cause any more damage.

00:16:27.550 --> 00:16:29.970
And all the others are so far away.

00:16:29.970 --> 00:16:32.240
I have to handle this myself.

00:16:32.240 --> 00:16:33.380
Which means...

00:16:33.830 --> 00:16:35.510
My only option is close combat.

00:16:37.730 --> 00:16:40.880
Draccoon, I need to borrow your senses!

00:16:40.880 --> 00:16:41.900
Gysoni!

00:16:43.700 --> 00:16:47.930
Sorry, but I can't put you down on the ground.
 It's too dangerous.

00:16:47.930 --> 00:16:49.900
I-I'll fight, too!

00:16:49.900 --> 00:16:51.580
That's brave of you.

00:16:51.580 --> 00:16:55.930
But there's something much more important
 I need a hero like you to do.

00:16:55.930 --> 00:16:56.660
Huh?

00:16:56.660 --> 00:16:59.190
Hold these reins tight,

00:16:59.190 --> 00:17:01.290
and don't take your eyes off the monster.

00:17:02.290 --> 00:17:03.460
Got it!

00:17:03.460 --> 00:17:05.540
I'll be rooting for you, lady!

00:17:05.540 --> 00:17:07.860
All right, I'll be back soon!

00:17:21.310 --> 00:17:22.270
Deine!

00:17:29.850 --> 00:17:33.320
I guess I'll have to take out 
the other Echoes in the same way.

00:17:33.320 --> 00:17:36.570
<i>Draccoon, go up higher.</i>

00:17:37.430 --> 00:17:38.610
<i>Higher!</i>

00:17:45.020 --> 00:17:47.430
<i>N-No... There are so many.</i>

00:17:50.910 --> 00:17:52.710
<i>I have to do something.</i>

00:17:52.710 --> 00:17:56.590
<i>But I can't deal with so many of them alone.</i>

00:17:58.840 --> 00:18:01.120
Come back!

00:18:01.120 --> 00:18:03.730
Hey! This way!

00:18:03.730 --> 00:18:05.850
Stop this stupid contest!

00:18:05.850 --> 00:18:08.850
I need manpower over here!

00:18:10.450 --> 00:18:13.190
<i>They're too far away. This is bad!</i>

00:18:13.670 --> 00:18:17.170
<i>I can see everything, thanks to Draccoon,</i>

00:18:17.170 --> 00:18:18.900
<i>but I have to stop the Nemesis!</i>

00:18:19.330 --> 00:18:20.700
<i>What can I do?</i>

00:18:21.210 --> 00:18:23.750
<i>Of course! If I use Gysoni,</i>

00:18:23.750 --> 00:18:26.830
<i>I can share one consciousness 
with all the knights at once!</i>

00:18:26.830 --> 00:18:28.250
<i>But...</i>

00:18:28.250 --> 00:18:29.830
Damn you!

00:18:29.830 --> 00:18:31.950
How many times must I say it?!

00:18:31.950 --> 00:18:34.960
You people are nothing on your own!

00:18:35.830 --> 00:18:39.720
Your individual thoughts and 
abilities are useless in battle!

00:18:39.720 --> 00:18:42.350
But you should be careful.

00:18:42.350 --> 00:18:45.210
There are certain behaviors 
that men are applauded for,

00:18:45.210 --> 00:18:48.980
but when women do the same, 
they're seen as impertinent.

00:18:48.980 --> 00:18:54.170
They may hold me at the top,
 but the knights are a society of men.

00:18:54.170 --> 00:18:56.990
There are those
 who do not see you favorably.

00:18:57.540 --> 00:18:58.950
Take my advice:

00:18:58.950 --> 00:19:02.550
try not to draw too much attention 
to yourself until your ordination.

00:19:05.470 --> 00:19:07.830
I can't stand out until my ordination.

00:19:08.390 --> 00:19:12.660
If I disobey orders again,
 I might not become a Knight-sorcerer.

00:19:13.130 --> 00:19:14.940
I have to follow orders...

00:19:15.660 --> 00:19:18.260
Follow orders... Orders...

00:19:18.260 --> 00:19:21.340
Order? What order?

00:19:21.340 --> 00:19:24.470
So you don't care what you
 have to do to accomplish that?

00:19:24.900 --> 00:19:25.860
No!

00:19:27.540 --> 00:19:31.470
For me...
 The Knight-sorcerer I want to become...

00:19:31.470 --> 00:19:33.660
protects and helps the people.

00:19:34.270 --> 00:19:38.540
I don't want to be a coward
 who ignores their pain because of some order!

00:19:38.540 --> 00:19:43.240
I can't be a coward who would throw away
 people's lives for her own ordination!

00:19:44.740 --> 00:19:45.660
Gysoni!

00:19:49.060 --> 00:19:51.290
The Gysoni contact has broken?

00:19:51.810 --> 00:19:53.260
What happened?

00:19:54.890 --> 00:19:56.790
Where are you all going?!

00:19:57.370 --> 00:19:59.420
<i>Gysoni is maintaining itself?</i>

00:19:59.420 --> 00:20:02.550
<i>And their flames are stronger than mine?!</i>

00:20:02.950 --> 00:20:04.490
<i>What's going on?</i>

00:20:17.390 --> 00:20:18.320
Disperse!

00:20:20.070 --> 00:20:22.570
Volley fire! Begin!

00:20:24.570 --> 00:20:26.950
Protect the people

00:20:26.950 --> 00:20:31.450
and get rid of everything 
that threatens them!

00:20:31.450 --> 00:20:36.380
We are the proud Knights-sorcerers 
of Caislean Merlin!

00:20:36.380 --> 00:20:40.510
All we do is for the life of this land!

00:20:53.020 --> 00:20:57.310
Looks like... we defeated all the Echoes.

00:20:58.790 --> 00:21:00.900
I'm... glad.

00:21:06.890 --> 00:21:08.740
What just happened?

00:21:08.740 --> 00:21:10.920
I think we used Gysoni...

00:21:10.920 --> 00:21:13.750
But I didn't hear anything after that.

00:21:13.750 --> 00:21:16.290
I couldn't even hear 
Lord Brangoire's voice.

00:21:16.290 --> 00:21:17.670
Same here.

00:21:17.670 --> 00:21:20.160
I wasn't even using Gysoni.

00:21:20.160 --> 00:21:22.490
Look! The Echo Nemesis!

00:21:22.490 --> 00:21:23.670
They're all dead!

00:21:24.110 --> 00:21:26.120
Did we do that?

00:21:26.120 --> 00:21:28.020
I don't remember it at all.

00:21:28.020 --> 00:21:31.430
Where did all these Echoes come from, anyway?

00:21:33.660 --> 00:21:36.010
Sagramore! Over there!

00:21:36.010 --> 00:21:37.540
Look near the building!

00:21:38.730 --> 00:21:40.230
Is that Ocoho?

00:21:40.230 --> 00:21:42.730
What is that child doing on her dragon?

00:21:42.730 --> 00:21:44.490
Knight lady!

00:21:51.290 --> 00:21:53.930
It appears that the Echo Nemesis,

00:21:53.930 --> 00:21:58.530
as well as the Source Nemesis,
 have been defeated by the Knights-sorcerers.

00:21:58.530 --> 00:21:59.960
All according to plan.

00:21:59.960 --> 00:22:01.930
"According to plan"?

00:22:01.930 --> 00:22:06.970
Weren't the actions
 of that girl Knight-sorcerer unexpected?

00:22:06.970 --> 00:22:12.220
Well, yes, that young lady's strength
 surprised me a bit.

00:22:12.220 --> 00:22:18.230
But I believe her strength
 will actually bring us great profit.

00:22:18.730 --> 00:22:19.930
Ocoho...

00:22:20.420 --> 00:22:27.250
Let us have her continue
 to be the cornerstone of our plan.

00:22:25.990 --> 00:22:29.990
To Be Continued

00:24:00.000 --> 00:24:20.790
<b>Next Time</b>

00:24:00.670 --> 00:24:02.900
<i>Fantasia is the power of imagination.</i>

00:24:02.900 --> 00:24:06.450
<i>A link with Fantasia
 is a link with the world.</i>

00:24:06.450 --> 00:24:11.790
<i>Armed with Myr's teachings, Seth faces
 the darkness within himself once more.</i>

00:24:12.270 --> 00:24:15.380
<i>He attempts to restrain 
the darkness with Fantasia,</i>

00:24:15.380 --> 00:24:17.330
<i>but it is eroded away.</i>

00:24:17.330 --> 00:24:20.020
<i>Can Seth defeat the darkness?</i>

00:24:20.020 --> 00:24:23.690
<i>Next time on <i>Radiant</i>, 
"Now, Feel the World."</i>

00:24:20.790 --> 00:24:25.020
<b>Now, Feel the World 
-Resonance-</b>

00:24:25.020 --> 00:24:30.250
<b>Meanwhile, in Artemis...</b>

00:24:25.020 --> 00:24:30.250
<b>How about Artemis-style milk coffee stew
 for a new product?</b>

00:24:25.020 --> 00:24:30.250
<b>My daughter's a genius!</b>

00:24:25.020 --> 00:24:30.250
<b>End</b>
